# ChoiceTime architecture

E-commerce watch & fashion store. Pair-program against this layout; do not invent a different stack.

- **Frontend**: React (Vite/CRA), vanilla CSS or Tailwind, in `/frontend`. Hosted on **Vercel**; deploys on `git push origin main`.
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express in `/backend` (`/routes`, `/controllers`, `/models`, `/services`). API: `https://api.choicetime.in/api`. Hosted on **AWS EC2** `13.233.112.102` via **PM2**.
- **Database**: MongoDB Atlas.
- **Repo**: `sumitbolla7/ChoiceTime`, branch `main`.

Storefront files include `CategoryPage.jsx`, `Navbar.jsx`, `Home.jsx`, `ProductCard.jsx`, `api.js`. Admin: `AdminDashboard.jsx`.

## Deploy

- Frontend-only: push `main` (Vercel).
- Backend changes: after merge/push, `git pull` on EC2 then `pm2 restart all`. Do not assume Vercel restarts the API.
